Single-database Alembic configuration managed by Flask-Migrate.

Common commands (run from backend/, with FLASK_APP=wsgi.py and DATABASE_URL set):

  flask db upgrade            apply migrations
  flask db downgrade base     revert to empty schema
  flask db migrate -m "msg"   autogenerate a new revision from model changes
  flask db history            list revisions

The initial revision (0001_initial_schema) is hand-written to match the spec's data model.
